%% GeoAI Metapanel — Data Flow (Voice → LLM → TTS → Avatar)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant UI as UI (Electron/React)
  participant OWW as OpenWakeWord (Python, open-source)
  participant WH as Whisper.cpp (open-source STT)
  participant CE as Conversation Context Engine
  participant OR as Persona Orchestrator
  participant L1 as LLM (First panelist via Ollama/LM Studio/MLX)
  participant Lx as LLMs (Other panelists in parallel)
  participant PIP as Piper TTS (open-source)
  participant AV as BrandedAvatar + Captions

  U->>OWW: "Okay Panel..." (speech)
  OWW-->>UI: Wake word detected
  UI->>UI: Start VAD recording
  UI->>WH: WAV audio (16kHz mono)
  WH-->>UI: Transcript text
  UI->>CE: Provide transcript
  CE->>OR: Start round, pick first speaker
  OR->>L1: Prompt + system + context
  par Other panelists (parallel)
    OR->>Lx: Prompts
    Lx-->>CE: Responses (stream)
  end
  L1-->>CE: Response (stream)
  CE-->>PIP: Text for first panelist
  PIP-->>AV: Audio + visemes
  AV-->>U: Spoken response + animated avatar
  WH-->>AV: Live captions overlay

